1
00:00:00,609 --> 00:00:02,579
(Penny:)I think.

2
00:00:02,578 --> 00:00:05,108
(Sheldon:)Did I misspeak
about the ring?

3
00:00:05,113 --> 00:00:07,083
(Leonard:)Yes, and we'll get
back to that.

4
00:00:07,082 --> 00:00:08,912
(Leonard:)But, uh, even with
your mother here,

5
00:00:08,917 --> 00:00:12,717
(Leonard:)you are deliberately hogging
all the attention from my mom.

6
00:00:12,721 --> 00:00:14,451
(Leonard:)You're like one of those
elephant seal pups

7
00:00:14,456 --> 00:00:17,126
(Leonard:)that steals the milk
from two mothers!

8
00:00:17,125 --> 00:00:19,525
(Sheldon:)Do you mean
what marine biologists

9
00:00:19,528 --> 00:00:22,128
refer to as "super weaning"?

10
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:24,830
Yes, you are a super weaner!

11
00:00:27,935 --> 00:00:30,105
(Sheldon:)Well, now I have to correct you.

12
00:00:30,105 --> 00:00:32,935
A-As a bit
of an elephant seal buff,

13
00:00:32,941 --> 00:00:34,611
(Sheldon:)the more accurate
comparison

14
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:36,710
(Sheldon:)would be when two mother seals

15
00:00:36,712 --> 00:00:38,882
(Sheldon:)actively seek
to nourish the same pup.

16
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:41,110
(Sheldon:)So I believe the term
you're looking for

17
00:00:41,116 --> 00:00:44,886
(Sheldon:)is a double mother suckler.

18
00:00:44,886 --> 00:00:47,116
(Leonard:)Yeah, you're right.

19
00:00:47,122 --> 00:00:48,822
(Leonard:)That is the term
I'm looking for.

20
00:00:48,824 --> 00:00:52,194
(Leonard:)You are a dirty double
mother suckler!

21
00:00:54,462 --> 00:00:57,162
(Sheldon:)Okay, well, now that we have the
terminology straightened out.

22
00:00:57,165 --> 00:01:00,025
How dare you!

